Revision history for Curl-Impersonate

0.03  2026-10-16
    - Handle HEAD responses correctly when reusing connections.
    - Preserve upload methods and bodies across redirects.
    - Propagate streaming callback failures.

0.02  2026-09-02
        - new decode option: decompress the response body

0.01  2026-08-25
    - initial release: an HTTP client that reproduces a chosen browser's TLS and
      HTTP/2 fingerprint, over libcurl-impersonate via Alien::curlimpersonate
      0.02. Blocking and curl_multi-backed asynchronous interfaces, the latter
      with streaming, backpressure and event-loop integration.
